This kit includes the standalone design tokens, theme runtime, selected
shadcn-style React components (`@zcode-ui/core`), and selected AI UI elements
(`@zcode-ui/ai-elements`) from packages/ui. It does NOT include the ZCode
application shell, agent runtime, login, git, Electron telemetry, or brand logo assets.

Selected files under `@zcode-ui/ai-elements` (and formerly under core in 0.2.0:
shimmer, suggestion, snippet) are derived from vercel/ai-elements (Apache-2.0),
as adapted in ZCode packages/ui. The standalone `code-block` follows the
vercel/ai-elements shiki implementation rather than ZCode’s Mermaid-coupled variant.
See file header comments for provenance.

Third-party runtime dependencies (radix-ui, lucide-react, cmdk, class-variance-authority,
clsx, tailwind-merge, react-resizable-panels, recharts, motion, shiki, ai, Tailwind CSS,
shadcn CSS helpers, etc.) retain their own licenses; see each package's NOTICE /
license files when redistributing.
